✅ 3️⃣ Terraform (Infrastructure as Code – Very Important)
🔹 Basic EC2 Creation Code
Hcl
Copy code
provider "aws" {
  region = "ap-south-1"
}

resource "aws_instance" "myec2" {
  ami           = "ami-0c55b159cbfafe1f0"
  instance_type = "t2.micro"

  tags = {
    Name = "MyCloudServer"
  }
}
🔹 Commands to run Terraform
Bash
Copy code
terraform init
terraform plan
terraform apply
